I want you to picture a simple math problem, the kind you might see in a middle school arithmetic class.

04:08.580 --> 04:09.420
Okay, I'm picturing it.

04:09.520 --> 04:11.060
Imagine it written out on that whiteboard.

04:11.180 --> 04:11.740
Three times.

