Classic order of operations problem.

04:20.860 --> 04:21.260
Exactly.

04:21.700 --> 04:24.780
We have all been taught the exact same algorithm to solve this, right?

04:25.300 --> 04:26.480
The order of operations.

04:27.420 --> 04:27.780
PEMDIS.

