Semantic persistence is the mathematical truth of the program.

16:07.980 --> 16:08.720
Okay, I'm following.

16:08.720 --> 16:16.740
Just because an object or a step remains part of the mathematical history doesn't mean it has to sit in active, high-speed RAM forever.

